usage: aiflow [-h] [--version]
              {start,begin,close,classify,freeze,answer,approve,escalate,resolve,status,verify,gate,validate,scope,sync}
              ...

Auditable AI code collaboration CLI

positional arguments:
  {start,begin,close,classify,freeze,answer,approve,escalate,resolve,status,verify,gate,validate,scope,sync}
    start               create or recover an AI Flow task
    begin               begin implementation or retry
    close               record an externally completed merge
    classify            classify a task using the active Policy
    freeze              validate and freeze a task specification
    answer              record an ASK selection and freeze its spec
    approve             record a version-bound approval
    escalate            raise a task's governance route
    resolve             record evidence for an escalation condition
    status              show a read-only task summary
    verify              run controlled verification
    gate                evaluate the read-only merge gate
    validate            validate governed task artifacts
    scope               validate the final task Git scope
    sync                synchronize an explicitly scoped task subject

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --version             show program's version number and exit
